          "snippet": {
            "text": "def cumulant (k : ℕ) (i : Row X) (c : AxisX X) : Marks.Algebra (Mark X i) :=\n  Poly.inject fun v => (∑ s : Mark X i, if v.val={s} then Y.one k i c s else 0) +\n    ∑ s : Mark X i, ∑ t : Mark X i, if s<t ∧ v.val={s,t} then Y.pair k i c s t else 0",
